      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Jesus compared himself to a vine and his followers to branches. A branch that stays connected to the vine can grow and produce fruit.",
          "ko": "예수님은 자신을 포도나무에, 제자들을 가지에 비유하셨어요. 포도나무에 붙어 있는 가지는 자라서 열매를 맺을 수 있어요."
        },
        {
          "text": "But a branch that is cut off from the vine cannot do anything on its own. It simply dries up and withers away.",
          "ko": "하지만 포도나무에서 잘려나간 가지는 스스로 아무것도 할 수 없어요. 그저 말라서 시들어버려요."
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said the greatest love is giving up your life for your friends. He then called his followers his friends, not just his servants.",
